#: ../userguides/reference.rst:103 91ba185f524848e196f2abe2f3fec0e8
msgid "Forest mapping classes"
msgstr "森林测绘类"

#: ../userguides/reference.rst:105 a9d8c8583be147e8bd3c9be04a9b9a2f
msgid ""
"Here is presented a list of classes for the Forest vegetation Mapping Model."
" There are two options for forest semantic classification:"
msgstr "这里提供了森林植被映射模型的类列表。森林语义分类有两种选择："

#: ../userguides/reference.rst:108 8b0b795a3004426e891aa26c42011ee1
msgid ""
"Classification by heights – classification of the areas of vegetation and "
"shrub vegetation by height classes according to the specified thresholds: "
"0-4 m, 4-10 m, 10+ m. Forest areas of each height class are polygonized in "
"separate features, the height class is indicated in its properties. Heights "
"thresholds are customizable values in the processing pipeline."
msgstr ""
"按高度分类 – 根据指定阈值按高度类别对植被和灌木植被面积进行分类：0-4 m、4-10 m、10+ "
"m。每个高度等级的森林区域在单独的要素中多边形化，高度等级在其属性中指示。高度阈值是处理管道中的可定制值。"

#: ../userguides/reference.rst:110 fef8351b8c2a43f8aaa6a14049473ba1
msgid ""
"Classification by overgrowth density – classification of the area of "
"vegetation and shrub vegetation into classes according to the density and "
"height: high forest, low (growing) forest, open woodland, and shrub."
msgstr "按过度生长密度分类——根据密度和高度将植被和灌木植被面积分为几类：高森林、低（生长）森林、开阔林地和灌木。"

